Aggregate, Iterator, WorkIterator: all WorkNode and Iterator values changed to pointers

Aggregate:
made abstract, createIterator() returns Iterator*
added virtual destructor

Iterator:
made abstract, all four methods pure virtual
added virtual destructor

WorkIterator:
added constructor taking the WorkNode* to traverse
added virtual destructor
first() positions on the first Ready WorkUnit in the tree, next() moves to the next one, isDone() when none are left
traversal is depth first using getChild() and getParent(), never leaves the node it was created on

WorkNode:
createIterator() returns WorkIterator* (new WorkIterator(this))
added #include <string>
